  "title": "Slow Cooked Ribs",
  "description": "Pork ribs are baked in the oven, then cooked in a slow cooker for hours with ketchup, brown sugar, Worcestershire sauce, Dijon mustard, and garlic.",
  "authors": [
    "aimeejean"
  ],
